  "part_of_speech": "godan verb, transitive",
  "gloss": "to reap; to harvest; to mow",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to reap; to harvest; to mow; to cut down",
      "explanation": "To cut and gather crops, grass, or other plants. Used literally for agricultural harvesting and lawn care."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "21025_karitoru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{稲|いね}→稲：01820_ine⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る。",
      "english": "To harvest the rice.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21025_karitoru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{秋|あき}→秋：02276_aki⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦なる→なる：01970_naru⟧⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦{農家|のうか}→農家：03539_nouka⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{稲|いね}→稲：01820_ine⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る。",
      "english": "When autumn comes, farmers harvest the rice.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "21025_karitoru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{雑草|ざっそう}→雑草：04996_zassou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{伸|の}び→伸びる：01974_nobiru⟧すぎた⟦の→の：09472_no⟧で、⟦{週末|しゅうまつ}→週末：03030_shuumatsu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧⟦まとめて→まとめる：02424_matomeru⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}った。",
      "english": "The weeds had grown too tall, so I mowed them all down over the weekend.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A compound verb from ⟦{刈|か}る→刈る：02043_karu⟧ (to mow, cut) + ⟦{取|と}る→取る：00565_toru⟧ (to take). The ⟦{取|と}る→取る：00565_toru⟧ component adds the nuance of taking or gathering what has been cut.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{稲|いね}→稲：01820_ine⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る: to harvest rice\n- ⟦{麦|むぎ}→麦：05427_mugi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る: to harvest wheat\n- ⟦{雑草|ざっそう}→雑草：04996_zassou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る: to mow weeds\n- ⟦{芝生|しばふ}→芝生：03196_shibafu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{刈|か}り{取|と}る: to mow the lawn\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{刈|か}る→刈る：02043_karu⟧: to mow, to cut — simpler verb; focuses on the cutting action without the gathering nuance\n- ⟦{収穫|しゅうかく}→収穫：03207_shuukaku⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to harvest — broader term for harvesting any crop; more formal\n- ⟦{摘|つ}み{取|と}る→摘み取る：15061_tsumitoru⟧: to pick, pluck — for hand-picking fruits, flowers, or tea leaves\n\nUSAGE:\nOccasionally used figuratively to mean reaping consequences or benefits, similar to English \"you reap what you sow.\"",
